        "8631": {"comment":"HL = past it"},
        "8635": {"synopsis":"Pixel row: C bytes from HL (the row below) to DE; with +$1E bit 3 (hi-res, hi-colour) the\nsecond file's too, at + $8000 (page 11 in MMU 6).\nKeeps BC, DE, HL.","comment":"Kept"},
        "8638": {"comment":"Copied up"},
