        "8659": {"synopsis":"Pixel row: C bytes at DE cleared; with +$1E bit 3 the second file's too: 0 in hi-res, the\ncolour +$1F in hi-colour (bit 2).\nKeeps DE.","comment":"DE kept"},
        "8660": {"comment":"B = the width"},
