        "3911": {"comment":"HL = the next line"},
        "3914": {"synopsis":"A program in a bank: lines from $C002; the index at ($FFF8), or a plain search when $C001\nbit 7 says it has none.","comment":"The bank's lines start at $C002"},
        "3917": {"comment":"$C001 bit 7: no room for an index?"},
        "3921": {"comment":"Then a plain search from the start"},
