        "4046": {"synopsis":"Where to start looking for line BC in a program held in a bank: with no index ($C001 bit 7\nset) HL = $C002 and NZ; otherwise LINE_INDEX_LOOK with the index at ($FFF8). Called from\n$398D.","comment":"$C001 bit 7 set: the bank has no index"},
        "4051": {"comment":"HL = $C002, the first line"},
