        "6011": {"synopsis":"$9A n [, offset, length]: a 16K RAM bank, type 3 from $C000 + offset. Without the two: 16K\nfor SAVE, 0 (the file's) for the others. Offset + length must stay in the 16K (report B).\n$5B65 = the bank, which $32D0 checks.","comment":"$9A?"},
