        "6097": {"synopsis":"$9C: the current screen mode's picture: modes 0 and 5 as SCREEN$; mode 2 (Layer 2) type 5,\n48K; the others type 4, 12K ($3000); start 0. $5B65 = $FE.","comment":"$9C?"},
