        "6326": {"synopsis":"Type 0: the length (E_LINE - PROG - 1, the program and its variables) and the program's own\nlength (VARS - PROG); LOAD, VERIFY and MERGE clear E_PPC and the word at $D74E in bank 7\n($1C9B) first.","comment":"Type 0: a program"},
