        "15126": {"synopsis":"Stops with error code $16 (report N, \"Statement lost\").","comment":"Error code $16 (report N)"},
        "15128": {"synopsis":"Looks down the GO SUB stack from its newest entry (ERR_SP + 3, each entry's type byte) for\none of type C, after $5B9A = 1 and the DivMMC memory's $28A2:\n1. Type C: found (Z, NC; HL at the type byte).\n2. Type $4B: passed (11 bytes).\n3. Types 0-1: a variable-length entry (its length word after the type) passed when C bit 5\n   is set, a type-1 entry whose first byte is 0 putting its 5 bytes back (RESTORE_5_BYTES);\n   with C bit 5 clear the search ends there.\n4. Types 2-$3D: with C = $20 the search ends there; otherwise passed (11 bytes) while C AND\n   $E0 is not below the type, and ends with carry at a higher type.\n5. $3E (the end marker): carry, not found. Types $3F-$47 (5-byte entries) record the DATA\n   state at $5B99 and $5B9B; $48 is passed by the DivMMC memory's $2880; higher types are\n   $82 bytes, passed by the DivMMC memory's $28EE; all of these end the search with carry\n   when C bit 5 is clear.\nCalled from $0BA2, $1EDF, $1F98, $23CE, $3550, $3AC4.","comment":"$5B9A = 1: no DATA state"},
        "15133": {"comment":"The DivMMC memory's $28A2"},
        "15138": {"synopsis":"The search without $5B9A and $28A2. Called from $2082, $2091.","comment":"ERR_SP"},
        "15141": {"comment":"- 8 (+ 11 next: ERR_SP + 3)"},
        "15145": {"synopsis":"Past an 11-byte entry.","comment":"The next entry"},
        "15149": {"synopsis":"The entry's type byte.","comment":"Its type"},
        "15150": {"comment":"The one wanted?"},
        "15152": {"comment":"$4B: passed"},
        "15156": {"comment":"Types 0-1?"},
        "15160": {"comment":"$3E: the end"},
        "15164": {"comment":"Above: the high types"},
        "15166": {"comment":"Looking for $20?"},
        "15169": {"comment":"Then this one"},
        "15170": {"comment":"C's class"},
        "15172": {"comment":"Not below the type? On"},
        "15176": {"synopsis":"Types 0-1: a variable-length entry.","comment":"C bit 5 clear: this one"},
