        "15253": {"comment":"HL = its distance from ERR_SP"},
        "15260": {"comment":"The DivMMC memory's $28EE"},
        "15265": {"comment":"Back"},
        "15267": {"comment":"$82 bytes on"},
        "15274": {"synopsis":"Puts back the 5 bytes a type-1 GO SUB stack entry holds (just before HL), at the place 8\nbytes before HL records (a bank byte and an offset):\n1. Bank $FF: at PROG + the offset.\n2. Bank $FE: nothing.\n3. A bank: through $5CAA, into the bank paged at $C000 ($32D0) at the offset, bank 0 back;\n   and when that place is within the cached line, into the line cache too ($5DB1 + its\n   distance from $5EBB).\nKeeps BC, HL.","comment":"Kept"},
        "15276": {"comment":"8 back"},
        "15280": {"comment":"A = the bank"},
        "15282": {"comment":"BC = the offset"},
        "15286": {"comment":"$FF, main memory?"},
        "15289": {"comment":"DE = PROG + the offset"},
