        "15660": {"synopsis":"An integer variable (%a, the letter's number 0-25 in A'): with '(' an array\n(VAR_STACK_INTA); otherwise its value allowed (VAR_VALUE), an 8-byte entry of type $48\n(GOSUB_ALLOC) filled by the DivMMC memory's $2864, $24F1 (when a value was given) and $28B5.\nExit: carry.","comment":"Past the '%'"},
