        "15729": {"comment":"The DivMMC memory's $28D8"},
        "15734": {"comment":"Carry"},
        "15736": {"synopsis":"Makes HL bytes of room on the GO SUB stack (HL negative) below the three words on top of the\nmachine stack (VAR_STACK's return, the statement loop's return, the error address): SP must\nstay at least $50 above STKEND (report 4 otherwise); the first byte = A; the three words\nback above it, ERR_SP at the error address.\nExit: HL = the second byte of the room.","comment":"IX = the return address"},
        "15738": {"comment":"The three words off"},
        "15743": {"comment":"HL = SP - the size"},
        "15744": {"comment":"STKEND"},
