        "15774": {"synopsis":"Three bytes, 1, 0, 0, copied onto the GO SUB stack by VAR_STACK ($3C76) as a string\nvariable's value when D bit 1 is set."},
        "15777": {"synopsis":"An optional '=' and value (VAR_ASSIGN_OPT), then the test of D: bit 5 set, or bit 7 or 6 set\ntogether with bit 6 or 5 (D x 3 bit 7), is not allowed (NC). Otherwise carry, A = D bit 7 (a\nvalue given).","comment":"'=' and a value?"},
        "15780": {"comment":"D bit 5?"},
