        "15795": {"synopsis":"At '=' (A): past it, the expression (ROM 3's SCAN_EXPR, DE and IX kept); with D bit 7\nalready set the value is dropped (STK_DROP); otherwise D = $80 + FLAGS bit 6 (a value of\nthat type). Other characters: nothing.","comment":"'='?"},
        "15799": {"comment":"Past it"},
