        "15961": {"synopsis":"With NZ (not the character wanted): carry, nothing. Otherwise past it, a variable (ROM 3's\nCLASS_1, through $05A3) that must be numeric (else report C); running, BC stacked (STACK_BC)\nand assigned (ASSIGN_CHECKED).\nExit: NC.\nEntry: BC = the value.","comment":"Not: carry"},
