        "7148": {"synopsis":"Maps the partitions of B units, from unit H, to drive letters from L: IDE_DOS_MAP for\npartition 0, 1, ... of each, until an error other than rc_unsuit ($09, unsuitable: the\npartition is skipped) or rc_mapped ($3E, the letter is taken: the next letter is tried).\nEach mapped drive gets its saved directory back (DRIVE_DIR_SET).\nExit: H = the unit after the last, L = the next free letter.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL.","comment":"Units left kept"},
        "7149": {"comment":"From partition 0"},
        "7152": {"synopsis":"One partition (BC) as drive L.","comment":"Partition kept"},
        "7153": {"comment":"Unit and letter kept"},
        "7154": {"comment":"A = the unit"},
        "7155": {"comment":"IDE_DOS_MAP: partition BC as drive L"},
        "7158": {"comment":"Unit and letter back"},
        "7160": {"comment":"Failed? By its error"},
        "7164": {"comment":"Its saved directory back"},
        "7167": {"comment":"Back"},
