        "4860": {"synopsis":"With '(' (bit 1): the character looked for in f$ (CPIR over the alternate set's DE', C');\nfound at place i, it becomes t$'s character i, or is dropped (STRMOD_DROP) when t$ is no\nlonger than i.","comment":"'('?"},
