        "8601": {"synopsis":"Runs the machine code when running (USR_CALL), AF kept in the alternate AF for it; then the\nresult by the carry kept: carry, a number, BC stacked ($2D2F) when running; no carry, a\nstring, DE and BC stacked (STK_STO_STR), then CALC_POINTERS ($35BF).","comment":"Kept"},
        "8602": {"comment":"For the code"},
        "8603": {"comment":"Running?"},
        "8607": {"comment":"Then the code"},
