        "10810": {"comment":"Pushed"},
        "10813": {"synopsis":"Does the name in the line end after its first letter? The character after the alternate HL,\nspaces skipped: carry when it is a letter or digit (ALPHANUM), no carry when the name ends.\nChanges: AF.","comment":"The other set"},
        "10814": {"comment":"Its HL kept"},
