        "10956": {"synopsis":"Evaluates a subscript (CLASS_6, TAKE_WORD) into BC against the limit HL. Exit: carry (A bit\n7 set) when it is 0 or over HL; nothing is checked when checking syntax.","comment":"A = 0: no mark yet"},
