        "14935": {"comment":"Then report B"},
        "14938": {"synopsis":"BC = -1; with a bank, PEEK_STR_COPY; otherwise counts the bytes from DE until (byte AND H) =\nL: H = $FF, L = t for ~t (t not counted); H = L = $80 for ~ (the bit-7 byte counted).","comment":"BC = -1: no limit"},
        "14941": {"comment":"A = the bank"},
        "14942": {"comment":"$FF + 1: no bank?"},
        "14943": {"comment":"A bank: copy it"},
        "14945": {"comment":"The start kept"},
