        "15032": {"synopsis":"'{' in an expression (the character table's word at $06F6): a string expression, then '}';\nrunning, the string (STK_FETCH) is handed to the other ROM's $17CF (through $1E5F); with\n$25DB as the return, the DE and BC it gives become the string result.","comment":"$25DB, the string result, as the return"},
        "15036": {"comment":"Past '{'"},
