        "15060": {"synopsis":"Opens BC bytes of room in the machine stack at HL (TEST_ROOM first, report 4 when they do\nnot fit): ERR_SP and DEFADD lowered by BC, and everything from SP up to HL moved down by BC\n(this routine's own return address with it). From $1D21 and $2848.\nExit: DE = HL - BC, the room above it; SP lower by BC.","comment":"Kept"},
        "15061": {"comment":"BC more fit? (report 4 if not)"},
        "15064": {"comment":"DE = HL"},
