        "15077": {"comment":"Lowered by BC"},
        "15079": {"comment":"Stored"},
        "15082": {"comment":"HL = SP"},
        "15086": {"comment":"HL = the given HL, DE = SP"},
        "15087": {"comment":"HL = the bytes from SP to it"},
        "15089": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "15090": {"comment":"HL = SP"},
        "15092": {"comment":"Less BC: the new SP"},
        "15094": {"comment":"BC = the bytes to move"},
        "15095": {"comment":"SP lowered"},
        "15096": {"comment":"DE = the new SP, HL = the old"},
        "15097": {"comment":"The stack moved down"},
        "15099": {"comment":"Back through the moved return address"},
        "15106": {"synopsis":"The calculator's operations: 66 words, the routine of each code $00-$41 (CALC_TABLE_INDEX,\nCALC_INDEX_ADD), in the 48K ROM's order: $00 jump-true $01 exchange $02 delete $03 subtract\n$04 multiply $05 division $06 to-power $07 or $08 no-&-no $09-$0E the number comparisons $0F\naddition $10 str-&-no $11-$16 the string comparisons $17 strs-add $18 val$ $19 usr-$ $1A\nread-in $1B negate $1C code $1D val $1E len $1F sin $20 cos $21 tan $22 asn $23 acs $24 atn\n$25 ln $26 exp $27 int $28 sqr $29 sgn $2A abs $2B peek $2C in $2D usr-no $2E str$ $2F chr$\n$30 not $31 duplicate (COPY_FP_ROOM) $32 n-mod-m $33 jump $34 stk-data $35 dec-jr-nz $36\nless-0 $37 greater-0 $38 end-calc $39 get-argt $3A truncate $3B 0 (no fp-calc-2) $3C e-to-fp\n$3D re-stack $3E series $3F stk-const $40 st-mem $41 get-mem. $3E-$41 are the groups of\ncodes $80 and up."},
        "15238": {"synopsis":"MOVE_POINTERS's body (from $165A, $1664 and $19F0): adds BC to the pointer variables that\npoint past HL: VARS; DEST only when it is below SP; then CHANS to STKEND ($5C4F-$5C65).\nKeeps AF and IX.\nExit: HL as given, DE = the old STKEND, BC = the bytes from HL to the old STKEND, both\nincluded.","comment":"AF kept"},
        "15239": {"comment":"IX kept"},
        "15241": {"comment":"IX = HL"},
        "15247": {"comment":"HL = VARS"},
        "15250": {"comment":"Is HL below VARS?"},
        "15254": {"comment":"No: VARS stays"},
        "15256": {"comment":"Yes: VARS + BC"},
        "15257": {"comment":"Stored"},
        "15260": {"synopsis":"DEST: moved only when below SP and past HL.","comment":"HL = DEST"},
        "15263": {"comment":"At SP or above?"},
        "15265": {"comment":"Then it stays"},
        "15267": {"comment":"HL = DEST again"},
        "15268": {"comment":"Is HL below DEST?"},
        "15274": {"comment":"No: DEST stays"},
        "15276": {"comment":"Yes: DEST + BC"},
        "15277": {"comment":"Stored"},
        "15280": {"synopsis":"CHANS to STKEND, one word at a time.","comment":"HL = CHANS, the first of the rest"},
        "15283": {"synopsis":"One pointer: moved when past HL.","comment":"DE = the pointer"},
        "15286": {"comment":"Is HL below it?"},
