        "15434": {"comment":"Done"},
        "15435": {"synopsis":"SCAN_OP_TABLE's $01: x shifted left by n (TAKE_BYTE_SIGN, 0-255; a negative n shifts right,\nSHIFT_RIGHT_OP's tail): x into the full form (CALC_RE_STACK) and n added to its exponent;\npast $FF is report 6.","comment":"A = n, Z for positive"},
        "15438": {"comment":"Negative: shifted right"},
