        "15491": {"synopsis":"SCAN_OP_TABLE's $3F: the two numbers combined bit by bit with XOR (IX = $3CFB), BIT_COMBINE.","comment":"IX = XOR (HL)"},
        "15495": {"comment":"BIT_COMBINE"},
