        "15507": {"synopsis":"Combines the numbers at HL and DE with the operation at IX (A op (HL), RET), the result in\nthe first:\n1. Two small integers: the sign, low and high bytes, pair by pair.\n2. Otherwise both full form, made two's complement and lined up as the addition does\n   (ADD_TWOS_COMPL, LOAD_MANTISSAS, SHIFT_RIGHT_A by the exponents' difference, the larger\n   exponent kept); the sign bytes and the four mantissa byte pairs combined, the second byte\n   of each through $5B5E; then the addition's ending (ADD_RESULT_SIGN).","comment":"Both exponent bytes 0 (small integers)?"},
        "15509": {"comment":"No: the full form"},
        "15511": {"comment":"DE kept"},
        "15512": {"comment":"3 bytes: the sign, low, high"},
        "15514": {"synopsis":"One byte pair.","comment":"The next pair"},
        "15516": {"comment":"A = the second's byte"},
        "15517": {"comment":"Combined with the first's (JP (IX))"},
        "15520": {"comment":"Into the first"},
        "15521": {"comment":"All three"},
        "15523": {"comment":"DE = the second: STKEND drops it"},
        "15524": {"comment":"Done"},
        "15525": {"synopsis":"The full form.","comment":"Both in the full form"},
        "15528": {"comment":"H'L' kept"},
        "15531": {"comment":"DE kept"},
        "15532": {"comment":"HL kept"},
        "15533": {"comment":"The first ready, A = its exponent"},
        "15536": {"comment":"B = it"},
